# Normalize all text files to LF line endings in the repository,
# regardless of each platform's local git config. Without this,
# Windows's core.autocrlf converts files to CRLF on checkout, which
# then conflicts with Prettier's default LF expectation - causing the
# same files to flip-flop as "needs reformatting" every session. This
# keeps Bogs (Windows) and AJ (Mac) on the same line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
